abstract: >-
  Maple procedures and worksheets, with a MATLAB driver, for the quasinormal modes of scalar, electromagnetic and
  vector-type gravitational perturbations of the noncommutative geometry-inspired dirty black hole, non-extremal and
  extremal. The exterior of the black hole is compactified, the quasinormal boundary conditions are built into a
  factorisation of the solution, and a Chebyshev collocation in multiprecision arithmetic gives a quadratic eigenvalue
  problem, solved with polyeig and the Advanpix toolbox.
